{"id":18838,"author":"Detluh","body":"Hello! I'm Atlantis999, here's a little about me:\u003cbr\u003eI'm 14 years old and I live in the US.\u0026nbsp;My first server was\u0026nbsp;MCSG in which I used to play on a different account. Recently, by the request of a friend,\u0026nbsp;I discovered Avicus and I've been really liking the gamemodes here. I don't consider myself too too good at pvp, but I do feel I'm about above average in both sword and bow at least. My favorite position is defending.\u003cbr\u003eIf you have any questions feel free to ask or just say hi! ;D","body_tagged":"Hello! I'm Atlantis999, here's a little about me:\u003cbr\u003eI'm 14 years old and I live in the US.\u0026nbsp;My first server was\u0026nbsp;MCSG in which I used to play on a different account. Recently, by the request of a friend,\u0026nbsp;I discovered Avicus and I've been really liking the gamemodes here. I don't consider myself too too good at pvp, but I do feel I'm about above average in both sword and bow at least. My favorite position is defending.\u003cbr\u003eIf you have any questions feel free to ask or just say hi! ;D","created_at":1450164359,"title":"Hi! I'm Atlantis999","replies":[{"id":258490,"author":"FrostedCupcakez","body":"Hey there Atlantis!\u003cbr\u003eWelcome to Avicus ^-^ Glad to know you're enjoying it here so far! Be sure to follow the rules ;)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI hope to see you around sometime, if you have any questions or concerns or just someone to talk to. Don't hesistate to ask! (:","body_tagged":"Hey there Atlantis!\u003cbr\u003eWelcome to Avicus ^-^ Glad to know you're enjoying it here so far! Be sure to follow the rules ;)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI hope to see you around sometime, if you have any questions or concerns or just someone to talk to. Don't hesistate to ask! (:","created_at":1450165332},{"id":258495,"author":"Subscriptor","body":"Yo\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWelcome to avicus :)","body_tagged":"Yo\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWelco